  "mach:weightsLicense": "Apache-2.0",
  "mach:trainingDataSummary": "Trained on Human Connectome Project (HCP) data — 105 subjects with high-quality diffusion MRI. Pre-trained weights included for 72 white matter bundles.",
  "mach:intendedUse": "Research tool for white matter bundle segmentation in neuroscience and clinical neurology research. Supports tractography-based analysis pipelines using FSL, MRtrix3, or dipy. Not a cleared medical device.",
